{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01785","headline":"杂曲歌辞 行路难三首 三 · 顾况","name":"杂曲歌辞 行路难三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见少年头上如云发，少壮如云老如雪。\n岂知灌顶有醍醐，能使清凉头不热。\n吕梁之水挂飞流，鼋鼍蛟蜃不敢游。\n少年恃险若平地，独倚长劒凌清秋。\n行路难，行路难，昔少年，今已老。\n前朝竹帛事皆空，日暮牛羊古城草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}